<title>CROATIA: Croatian hotelier offers three units for sale.</title>
<headline>Croatian hotelier offers three units for sale.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Croatian seaside hotelier Turisthotel on Monday offered for sale three hotels on the islands off the central Adriatic port of Zadar.</p>
<p>In an advertisement carried by Vjesnik daily Turisthotel offered previously state-owned Hotel Sali on Dugi Otok island and Hotel Zadranka on the Ugljan.</p>
<p>The third, Hotel Bozava on the Dugi Otok, was offered for sale or joint investment.</p>
<p>The tender, open to Croatian and foreign investors, closes on February 21. It did not set starting prices or terms of payment.</p>
<p>-- Laura Lui, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
